From: DrakeRamorayJr <179530612+DrakeRamorayJr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:43:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bare: dim and scale the page card behind the bottom sheet
 with a transparent status bar

In bottom-bar Sheet mode, replace the non-glass page blur with a smooth
progress-driven dim (~0.35) and card scale-down (~0.95) with 20dp
rounded corners over a dark backdrop, keeping blur only when Frosted
glass is enabled. Keep the status bar transparent edge to edge with no
cover strip or white band, switching only status-bar icon appearance
for contrast while open and restoring all page and status-bar state on
close. Top-bar Sheet mode and the side drawer are unchanged.
---
